{
  "_comment": [
    "Overrides for the second version of the prompt, layered in front of replies.json:",
    "    --replies resources/replies-prompt-v2.json --replies resources/replies.json",
    "Each rule matches on a line only the v2 prompt contains, so run A and run B really",
    "are two different questions -- which is the only way to have two runs to compare.",
    "The rendered prompt is not in the stage key, but the prompt *template* is (spec",
    "005), so editing the template is what makes the run ask again instead of serving",
    "run A's answer from the cache.",
    "",
    "Four deliberate differences, and only two of them are wrong:",
    "  PLAY-1001 loss_amount  'CHF 18'400' with currency CHF  -> correct   (R7.1)",
    "  PLAY-1001 severity     'MAJOR'                          -> correct   (R7.1)",
    "  PLAY-1001 date         '04.03.2026'                     -> INCORRECT (ambiguous)",
    "  PLAY-1002 date         '19.03.2026'                     -> correct   (no month is 19)",
    "  PLAY-1002 loss_amount  0.0 where gold says null         -> INCORRECT (R7.3)"
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "match": ["# PLAY-1001", "prefer the figure finance reconciled"],
      "reply": {
        "document": "PLAY-1001.md",
        "fields": [
          {
            "field": "loss_amount",
            "value": "CHF 18'400",
            "currency": "CHF",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "a recorded loss of CHF 18'400"}
          },
          {
            "field": "resolution_date",
            "value": "04.03.2026",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "**Resolved:** 2026-03-04"}
          },
          {
            "field": "severity",
            "value": "MAJOR",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "**Severity:** major"}
          },
          {
            "field": "affected_systems",
            "value": "checkout-api, payments-gateway",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {
              "document": "PLAY-1001.md",
              "span": "**Systems affected:** checkout-api, payments-gateway"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "match": ["# PLAY-1002", "prefer the figure finance reconciled"],
      "reply": {
        "document": "PLAY-1002.md",
        "fields": [
          {
            "field": "loss_amount",
            "value": 0.0,
            "currency": "CHF",
            "confidence": "medium",
            "source": {
              "document": "PLAY-1002.md",
              "span": "No financial loss was recorded for this incident."
            }
          },
          {
            "field": "resolution_date",
            "value": "19.03.2026",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1002.md", "span": "**Resolved:** 2026-03-19"}
          },
          {
            "field": "severity",
            "value": "minor",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1002.md", "span": "**Severity:** minor"}
          },
          {
            "field": "affected_systems",
            "value": "reporting-export",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {
              "document": "PLAY-1002.md",
              "span": "**Systems affected:** reporting-export"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
